  "bio": "Arthur Esteves, renowned for their expertise in fineline, floral, and watercolor tattoos, is highly celebrated for their exceptional professionalism. Working out of João Pessoa, Brazil, Arthur co-founded Alma da Arte Estúdio—a testament to their dedication to the craft. Esteves's masterful artistry not only adorns skin but also exemplifies the professional standards in the tattoo industry.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: João Pessoa, Paraiba, Brazil\n\n📍João Pessoa, PB - @almadartestudio",
